voter_vax_MonotoneEI.csv is the `voter_vax` data set of the MonotoneEI R package
(https://github.com/reglab/MonotoneEI, data/voter_vax.rda; MIT licence,
Copyright (c) 2025 MonotoneEI authors), written to CSV unchanged (columns
county_fips, prop_republican, prop_covid_vax, total_votes; 2059 counties).
Sources given there: MIT Election Data and Science Lab county presidential
returns 2000-2020 (Harvard Dataverse, doi:10.7910/DVN/VOQCHQ) and CDC COVID-19
vaccinations by county (data.cdc.gov 8xkx-amqh). Used only in the tests
(test-msign.R) as an external check of the 2x2 CR bounds.

